				<title>System Design: Enterprise Knowledge Assistant (RAG)</title>
				<link>https://samirsahoo.github.io/enterprise-ai/rag/case-study-knowledge-assistant/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://samirsahoo.github.io/enterprise-ai/rag/case-study-knowledge-assistant/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-interview-question&#34;&gt;The interview question&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#the-interview-question&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Design an AI assistant that lets 50,000 employees ask questions about internal policies, procedures and technical documentation, with answers grounded in company documents.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;This walk-through follows the &lt;a href=&#34;https://samirsahoo.github.io/enterprise-ai/interview-prep/ai-system-design-framework/&#34;&gt;AI system design framework&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-requirements&#34;&gt;1. Requirements&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#1-requirements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>System Design: Agentic Customer-Support Platform</title>
